        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CBN150SS4, Pacific 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts is available with either polished or satin stainless steel finished brackets and the acrylic can be clear or frosted. Choose from a wide variety of lengths. The modern brackets make this pull perfect for contemporary homes, especially since they are made from stainless steel. The Pacific Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CBN150SS4 Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PC06-specifications.pdf?v=1704262333\"><b>First Impressions CBN150SS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>CBN150018SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN150024SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN150036SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN150048SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" VALIGN=\"top\" >\r\n<b>CBN150060SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN150072SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN150084SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 84\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
